# Flux's default source exclusions drop binary/media files, *.png among them, so
# a PNG committed to git never reaches the cluster and any kustomization that
# references it fails to build with "no such file or directory".
#
# matrix-media-relay ships ghost avatars as PNGs in a ConfigMap, so re-include
# them. Scoped to that directory rather than repo-wide, to keep the rest of the
# default exclusions intact.
!kubernetes/apps/tools/matrix-media-relay/app/*.png
